<title>UK: London gold fixes barely changed as dollar climbs.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes barely changed as dollar climbs.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $343.90 vs $344.00 AM. Strengthening dollar working against gold's upside. Producer selling forecast above $345.00.</p>
<p>SILVER - Fairly steady at $4.73/$4.75 unchanged.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Indicated at $397.00/$401.00 down about $5.00. Stop loss selling on Nymex. Fairly thin. Almaz in Tokyo.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Down $6.50 at $170.50/$174.50</p>
</text>
